==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|emphatick}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἐμφατικός||emphatic}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἔμφασις}} (English {{m|en|emphasis}}), from {{m|grc|ἐμφαίνω||I show, present}}, from {{m|grc|ἐν||in}} + {{m|grc|φαίνω||I shine, show}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪmˈfætɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ætɪk|lang=en}}

